# Whitespace policy — third-party / third-party-derived artwork only.
#
# These SVG trees are not repository-authored. Their bytes are sha256-attested
# against pinned upstream commits by scripts/sync-clawd-pets.mjs, which reports
# any byte difference as upstream drift (npm run assets:check:clawd exits 1).
# Whitespace inside the vendored artwork is therefore preserved verbatim and
# git's whitespace diagnostics are disabled for exactly these three trees.
#
# Scope is intentionally narrow: this exception applies ONLY to the three
# approved asset trees below. It must never be widened to *.svg, src/**,
# public/** or the repository as a whole.

public/vendor/clawd-pet/pets/*.svg -whitespace
src/assets/clawd/*.svg -whitespace
src/assets/stickers/clawd/*.svg -whitespace
